<title>USA: Air Methods Corp Q3 shr lowers to $0.02.</title>
<headline>Air Methods Corp Q3 shr lowers to $0.02.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.02		    $0.03</p>
<p> Net		 158			280</p>
<p> Revs		7,700		    7,800</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.03		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net		 205			853</p>
<p> Revs		22,600		   22,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Air Methods Corp.</p>
<p>Drop in net income due to investment in modular medical interior system and medical interior development costs for the U.S. Army UH-60Q medevac multi-functional system.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
